From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer: audio: the effect factory as a public filegroup

Exposes the unchanged EffectFactory.cpp to apklayer's audio HAL entrypoint (a shared library loaded by
btload) through a public filegroup. Formerly part of scripts/patch-audio.sh.
Against hardware/interfaces 13fc23dae0dc (REVISION). Apply: patches/apply aosp <LineageOS tree>.
---
diff --git a/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp b/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp
index f46c2ee30d..002425af41 100644
--- a/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp
+++ b/audio/aidl/default/Android.bp
@@ -469,3 +469,10 @@ prebuilt_etc {
         default: false,
     }),
 }
+
+// apklayer patch: reuse the original effect factory in a shared-library entrypoint.
+filegroup {
+    name: "apklayer_audio_effect_factory_sources",
+    srcs: ["EffectFactory.cpp"],
+    visibility: ["//visibility:public"],
+}
